      <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 A1-3.17.2(a) (p. printed 44 / PDF 52); E3QA S1 (p. printed 1-2); FDA-PD24 SIII.B.2 (p. printed 7; lines 241-243, footnote 16; printed 7; lines 243-245, footnote 17)
