  <bpmn:process id="L3_P_SPON_PROCESS" name="Sponsor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Reading convention (orchestrator default, l3_cut): steps A2-A6 recur throughout trial conduct; the sequence shows the path of one deviation and the AND gateways show channels open in parallel; no loop markers. Shown as text annotation TA1 and group GR_CONDUCT.
Investigator/institution is a collapsed pool on L3 (orchestrator decision 06 Nov 2026): collapsed where it carries no tasks; D1 intent - investigator duties visible as tasks - unaffected, the duties are tasks in the L4 models.
L3 shows 10 key hand-offs (at most one per call activity and pool gap, sent by the call activity); every one reappears with the same label and pools in the called L4 (SCP-06). Further hand-offs exist only on L4.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="L3_P_SPON_LANESET">
      <bpmn:lane id="L3_L_MON" name="Monitor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 A1-3.11.4.5.1(a) (p. printed 32 / PDF 40); E6R3 A1-3.11.4.4 (p. printed 32 / PDF 40)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements>
          <ipd:trace>
            <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="A1-3.11.4.5.1(a)" page="printed 32 / PDF 40" />
            <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="A1-3.11.4.4" page="printed 32 / PDF 40" />
          </ipd:trace>
        </bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="L3_L_SPON" name="Sponsor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 GL:Sponsor (p. printed 90 / PDF 98); EUCTR Art. 2(2)(14) (p. OJ L 158/12); 21CFR312 21CFR312.50 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements>
          <ipd:trace>
            <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="GL:Sponsor" page="printed 90 / PDF 98" />
            <ipd:source key="EUCTR" loc="Art. 2(2)(14)" page="OJ L 158/12" />
            <ipd:source key="21CFR312" loc="21CFR312.50" page="n/a - eCFR web text without pagination" />
          </ipd:trace>
        </bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_S1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_G1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_G2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_G3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_G4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L3_A6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
